<div>
    <h3>以劳益美 | 郁金香盛放：共赴春约</h3>
   <div class="time"><span>发布时间：</span>2025-04-08 11:54:31<span>来源：</span>
    <span> 点击：</span><script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1482657449, 25542)</script></div>

    
    <div id="vsb_content"><div class="v_news_content">
<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: Calibri Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: Calibri;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #44546A;  --docx-lt2-color: #E7E6E6;  --docx-accent1-color: #4874CB;  --docx-accent2-color: #EE822F;  --docx-accent3-color: #F2BA02;  --docx-accent4-color: #75BD42;  --docx-accent5-color: #30C0B4;  --docx-accent6-color: #E54C5E;  --docx-hlink-color: #0026E5;  --docx-folhlink-color: #7E1FAD;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: Times New Roman;}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}p.docx_2 {  margin-top: 0.00pt;  margin-bottom: 0.00pt;  text-align: left;}p.docx_2 span {  font-family: 宋体;  font-weight: bold;  min-height: 24.00pt;  font-size: 24.00pt;}.docx table, table.docx_4 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}p.docx_3 {  margin-top: 0.00pt;  margin-bottom: 0.00pt;  margin-left: 0.00pt;  margin-right: 0.00pt;  text-align: left;}p.docx_3 span {  min-height: 12.00pt;  font-size: 12.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}span.docx_6 {  font-weight: bold;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p class="docx_2" style="border-width: 0pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0pt 0pt 7pt; line-height: calc(100% + 0.7pt); text-indent: 0pt; text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">春意盎然，海棠5号楼1楼社区生态花园内一片生机勃勃。去年深秋种下的郁金香种球，在社区师生共同的精心养护下，历经寒冬的酝酿，在这个春天绚烂绽放，为社区增添了不少明媚的色彩。这些由同学们亲手培育的花朵，凝结着同学们的汗水和付出，也让同学们体会到创造美的成就感。</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="null"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 303.8pt; height: 150.7pt;"><img src="/__local/5/5B/52/770BF0A6558664FCAB4F5165056_88A7FA55_182D6.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/55B52770BF0A6558664FCAB4F5165056/88A7FA55/182D6" vheight=" 150.7pt" vwidth=" 303.8pt" orisrc="/__local/A/75/6B/4707819E419A0400C28B907F494_5AEE3B89_16CA3.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 303.8pt; height: 150.7pt;"></span></span><span id="_GoBack"></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24.1pt; text-align: left;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">深耕厚植：躬身播撒希望之种</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">去年深秋时节，社区以"劳动创造美"为主题组织开展郁金香种植劳动教育实践。同学们在社区辅导员老师的指导下，严格按照种植规范完成选种、松土、浇灌等环节，亲身体验园艺劳动的完整流程。通过理论学习与实践操作，同学们感悟到"一锹一土养根性，一花一叶见匠心"的内涵。</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="null"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 300.5pt; height: 225.4pt;"><img src="/__local/7/6F/11/D8A0A0C18E683046E3CC1B1BE8A_E6224F31_73115.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/76F11D8A0A0C18E683046E3CC1B1BE8A/E6224F31/73115" vheight=" 225.4pt" vwidth=" 300.5pt" orisrc="/__local/4/75/1A/AADC2D1ADBB4157A08ADB00EBC9_2D06DCFA_14CB74.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 300.5pt; height: 225.4pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24.1pt; text-align: left;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">静待花开：汗水浇灌成长印记</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">在守护花开的过程中，同学们组成养护小组，定期为郁金香除草、松土、追肥。参与活动的同学说：“养护初期我们对松土深度和温度调控缺乏经验，现在不仅能熟练使用园艺工具，还会根据天气调整养护方案。在这个过程中，我们不仅掌握了园艺知识，更培养了责任意识和持之以恒的品格。”</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="null"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 311.45pt; height: 233.65pt;"><img src="/__local/F/47/CE/971C57E969EC75E870D34796D11_EFED5EE7_892C0.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/F47CE971C57E969EC75E870D34796D11/EFED5EE7/892C0" vheight=" 233.65pt" vwidth=" 311.45pt" orisrc="/__local/2/16/33/04D706A866708D8467509309CF9_FBD94051_18D758.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 311.45pt; height: 233.65pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24.1pt; text-align: left;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">繁花似锦：劳动之美浸润心田</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">历经四个月的精心养护和耐心等待，郁金香如期绽放，红如焰、黄似锦、粉若霞的花朵在春风中摇曳生姿，装点了社区花园美景。这场从秋种到春收的长期实践，让同学们深刻体会到“美”需要用双手去创造和守护。</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="null"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 311.4pt; height: 311.4pt;"><img src="/__local/3/E8/8A/5A9A4D639D0F059CE4012AD8047_2DBEA504_9CF32.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/3E88A5A9A4D639D0F059CE4012AD8047/2DBEA504/9CF32" vheight=" 311.4pt" vwidth=" 311.4pt" orisrc="/__local/D/C0/70/900D1583B344F5EF3BC6C946853_31A0EF34_19370E.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 311.4pt; height: 311.4pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">高年级学生社区（2021级）将持续丰富劳动教育形式，引导学生通过“学做合一”的方式，将课堂理论融入动手实践，培养踏实肯干、热爱劳动的品质，实现以劳增智、以劳益美的育人目标，让同学们在劳动中提升技能、收获成长。</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left;"><br></p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
